{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sama-yas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sama-yas-aldar-properties-yas-island","about":"Sama Yas by Aldar Properties is a premium residential development in Yas Park, Abu Dhabi, offering an exceptional collection of 1, 2  and 3 bedroom apartments, duplexes, garden apartments, and three exclusive penthouses. Designed for those seeking a balance of luxury and nature, this masterfully planned community immerses residents in a serene, verdant setting with seamless access to leisure and wellness facilities. Comprising 3 eight-level buildings, Sama Yas redefines modern living with sustainable, smart, and innovative interiors.Renowned Chef Izu curates the elegant kitchen spaces, while the meticulous craftsmanship of Woods Bagot, Mustard &amp; Linen brings a refined aesthetic to the interiors. The development aims to achieve Estidama 3 Pearl, Fitwel, and LEED Gold Certification, ensuring an eco-friendly and energy-efficient lifestyle. Sama Yas offers world-class amenities, including a boutique spa, concierge services, co-working spaces, a multipurpose lounge, and a theatre room. Fitness enthusiasts can enjoy a fully equipped gym, cycling and running tracks, outdoor work pods, and recreational areas. Nestled in Yas Island’s vibrant hub, this stunning community delivers the perfect blend of sustainability, luxury, and modern convenience.","price":1900000,"title":"Sama Yas","bitrix":{"id":1147,"pf_id":"are.2.13486","source":null,"project_id":"Sama Yas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sama Yas","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Yas Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_e67997d88c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_e67997d88c.webp"}],"st